    "notes": "No own website found. Legal entity BTCZ Ventures s.r.o., IČO 05277817, seat Evropská 2758/11, Praha 6 confirmed in ARES API (same address as bpd partners a.s.; PitchBook lead only: formerly XENO Ventures, founded 2016, not used as evidence). ARES JSON has datumVzniku 2016-08-01. hq_country CZ rests on the registered seat; team location not stated explicitly (the 2025 IOCB page quotes Miroslav Tvrzník of BPD Partners as the representative). BTCZ is a vehicle of BPD Partners Group and B3 Holding, so it may be a corporate/family arm rather than an independent VC; type vc is a judgment. Taveren: page says BTCZ is the largest shareholder and, in 2018 (EUR 1.75m) and June 2023 (EUR 1m), funded the research; amount and instrument of the Dec 2025 contribution not explicit, so role and instrument unknown. Stage, ticket, capital not published."
